Article 64

1. The provisions as referred to in Article 63 paragraph (1), may be exempted with due regard to the following requirements: a. age for child workers in informal sector work above 15 (fifteen) years;

b. obtain written consent from the parent/guardian of the child worker in informal sector work;
c. implementation must be set forth in a written work agreement between the company/employer and the parent/guardian of the child worker in informal sector work;

d. not employed at night;

e. working time of at most 3 (three) hours per day;

