Article 86

The development of CFC as referred to in Article 85, is implemented based on the following principles: a. good governance, namely transparency, accountability, participation, information disclosure, and rule of law;
b. non-discrimination, namely not differentiating ethnicity, race, religion, gender, language, political views, national origin, economic status, physical or psychological condition of the child, or other factors;

c. best interests of the child, namely making what is best for the child the primary consideration in every policy, program, and activity;

